        1387,
        1466
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "1. There is hereby created in the Office of the Mayor a position which shall be known as Assistant to the Mayor for Special Projects (Deputy for Special Projects). This Assistant shall serve without compensation but shall be reimbursed for such ordinary and necessary expenses as may be authorized by the Mayor or the Deputy Mayor and/or provided for by the Board of Estimate.",
